---
// ============================================================
// ROOT REDIRECT - / now sends visitors to /offer.
//
// The real redirect happens at the Cloudflare Pages edge via
// public/_redirects ("/ /offer 301") - a true HTTP 301, no flash,
// no JS required. This page is a fallback for contexts that don't
// honor that file (local `npm run preview`, a future non-Cloudflare
// host, etc.) so "/" never renders old page content either way.
//
// The old offer-page content that used to live at this route has
// been fully removed, not just hidden - it's no longer part of the
// live funnel. If you want a homepage again, this file is the one
// to rebuild.
// ============================================================
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/offer" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/offer" />
    <title>Redirecting…</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <script>
      window.location.replace("/offer");
    </script>
    <p>Redirecting to <a href="/offer">the offer page</a>&hellip;</p>
  </body>
</html>
